MintCurveConvexPositionFactory::setBeacon(address)
├── given caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
└── given caller is owner
    ├── when _beacon is zero address
    │   └── it should revert with MintCurveConvexPositionFactoryZeroAddress
    ├── given beacon is already set
    │   └── it should revert with MintCurveConvexPositionFactoryBeaconAlreadySet
    └── given beacon is not set
        ├── it should set beacon
        └── it should emit BeaconSet
